=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to {z:Navukgo Execution Chamber}.
** The {z:Mount Zhayolm} Home Point will take you right outside the zone. (Use {p:Unity Warp} > 135 > {z:Mount Zhayolm} if you do not have the {p:Home Point})
*** The {p:Unity Warp} will place you a short walk away from the zone. After arriving in {z:Mount Zhayolm}, immediately turn around. Head forward, then take the East junction at the (C-7)/(C-8) line. You can use your {p:Map} to locate the {p:Home Point} quickly.
* You will get a cutscene when you first enter {z:Navukgo Execution Chamber}.
* Examine the **Decorative Bronze Gate** for another cutscene.
* Examine the gate once more to enter a battlefield.
* The fight is against {m:Khimaira 13}.
* {m:Khimaira 13} uses the following special attacks:
** **Dreadstorm**: AoE DMG + terrorize. Removes {p:Utsusemi}.
** **Tenebrous Mist**: {p:TP} is reset to 0.
** **Thunderstrike**: AoE DMG + {s:Stun}. Removes {p:Utsusemi}.
** **Tourbillion**: AoE DMG + Knockback. Removes {p:Utsusemi}.
* Lady Karababa will assist you in this fight.
** She uses various high level spells and casts them much faster than players can. She seems to prefer Ancient Magic II spells.
** If her health drops too low and she has not been healed, she will {p:Warp} from the battlefield resulting in a loss.

